Subject: [PATCH] Fix Persian text and digit extraction from the audit PDF

- Add pdf_service.py: PyMuPDF body text, pdfplumber tables with per-cell
  bidi fix, and normalize_fa (NFKC, Arabic letter variants, mixed digits).
- Fix step_02 saving the unfixed table instead of the fixed one.
- Regenerate all_pages.txt and table_page_21.json.
- Add tests for text, tables, negative numbers and Excel figures.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
